msgid "Some OpenID Connect providers require that a client be authenticated as part of the mutual TLS (`mTLS`) authentication process."
msgstr "一部の OpenID Connect プロバイダーでは、相互 TLS (`mTLS`) 認証プロセスの一部としてクライアントを認証する必要があります。"

msgid "`quarkus-oidc-client` can be configured as follows to support `mTLS`:"
msgstr "`quarkus-oidc-client` can be configured as follows to support `mTLS`:"

#, fuzzy
